==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|усынови́ть|-я́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|усыновля́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|усыновля́ть|impf|pf=усынови́ть}}

# to [[adopt]], to [[affiliate]] {{gloss|to take by choice into relationship as child}}

====Usage notes====
* The term is derived from {{l|ru|сын|gloss=son}}, so originally it meant to make someone one's son. It is also used as a generic term for adoption. To refer to female adoption specifically, use {{l|ru|удочеря́ть}}

